@startuml F7.6-D03-listar-jobs-agendados
title F7.6-D03 — Listar jobs agendados
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "JobsController" as Ctrl
participant "ListScheduledJobsUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: seção Scheduled Jobs
WebApp -> Jwt: GET jobs agendados
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT runs
note right of UC
  OK / ATRASADO / FALHOU
  (somente leitura)
end note
Postgres --> UC: jobs
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: cards com status

@enduml
